    "Who We Are",
    "Centene Foundation",
    "Impact",
    "In 2025, Centene Foundation invested $34.9 million in 209 nonprofit organizations across 29 states and the District of Columbia — pairing local trust with national expertise to deliver sustainable, measurable improvements in community health and well-being.",
    "$34.9 M Total 2025 Disbursements",
    "30 Centene Markets",
    "209 Nonprofit partners",
    "71 Multi-Year Commitments",
    "With a focus on healthcare, social services and education, Centene Foundation's work is essential to Centene's mission of transforming the health of the communities we serve, one person at a time. It drives measurable improvements in community health and well-being through a distinctive, local approach to giving.",
    "Investments spanned three philanthropic pillars, plus $800,000 in disaster relief efforts.",
    "In 2025, the Foundation enhanced access to healthcare through a focus on community health centers, mobile health units, and maternal care programs for high-need communities.",
    "$15.9M Disbursed",
    "Throughout the year, key areas of focus for the Foundation included affordable housing, food insecurity and social isolation programs designed to address key drivers of health.",
    "$14.3M Disbursed",
    "In 2025, the Foundation supported several initiatives designed to accelerate healthcare workforce training and development in underserved communities.",
    "$3.9M Disbursed",
    "Multi-Year Commitments $29.8M | 71 partnerships",
    "Long-term, layered investments that enable partners to plan, build capacity, and deliver sustained outcomes.",
    "Single-Year Donations $5.0M | 164 donations",
    "Targeted, responsive investments that meet immediate community needs with speed and precision, including emergency disaster relief.",
    "In 2025, key focus areas included affordable housing, social connection, maternal and child health, and healthcare access and quality. Here’s a look at some of the ways we invest in communities:",
    "Centene Foundation and Health Net are contributing $10M over three years to rehabilitate and expand Encompass Housing's Community Care Campus in Long Beach. Located in a former hospital, the campus provides an integrated service hub for the most vulnerable populations, addressing critical drivers of health such as housing, workforce development, and behavioral health.",
    "$10M invested over 3 years",
    "Indiana University Health Foundation's Congregational Care Network supports seniors and other adults who are experiencing social isolation and need extra support and resources when they are transitioning from hospitals to homes or care facilities. A two-year, $770K commitment from the Centene Foundation and Managed Health Services will help expand the multi-faith network to serve an additional 12 congregations.",
    "$770k invested over 2 years",
    "Centene Foundation and Buckeye Health Plan are investing $1.65M over three years to expand the nationally recognized Pathways Community HUB Institute model across Ohio, with a focus on preventing preterm births. The Pathway Community HUBs operate as coordinated care networks that identify high-risk individuals, assess their health and social needs and connect them with appropriate services and resources.",
    "$1.65M invested over 3 years",
    "With our support, programs and projects that began as transformative ideas are now coming to fruition, delivering measurable impact in communities across the country.",
    "In July 2025, Centene Foundation, Superior HealthPlan, and Community Health Development Inc. (CHDI) celebrated the grand opening of Uvalde's new 16,000-square-foot Multi-Purpose Community Health Center.",
    "First announced in the immediate aftermath of the 2022 Robb Elementary School shooting, the center was made possible through a combined investment of more than $8M from the Foundation and Superior HealthPlan. Providing healthcare services, community outreach, education, and workspaces, the center embodies all three of the Foundation's philanthropic pillars.",
    "$8M+ invested",
    "Download the Year-End Report to see the full story behind our 2025 impact. Learn about our partner-first approach and explore disbursement breakdowns and partner highlights all in one place.",
    "PDF, 8 pages, 3.5 MB",
    "Transforming the health of the communities we serve, one person at a time.",
    "HEALTHCARE IS BEST DELIVERED LOCALLY",
    "Our uniquely local approach allows us to help members access quality-focused, culturally sensitive healthcare services.",
    "CENTENE IS COMMITTED TO CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY",
    "The health of individuals drives our focus on the environment, removing social barriers to health and prioritizing responsible corporate governance.",
    "© Copyright 2026 Centene Corporation"
  ],
